 "consequence": "Operations placed the flagged NovaTech–Orion outbound wires into temporary hold status and recorded your 48-hour documentation and screening requirements in the case file. The relationship manager acknowledged the hold, forwarded your checklist to NovaTech, and noted in an internal comment that shipment documents and invoices should be available within a day. After 24 hours, operations confirmed that no funds were released and that a reminder had been sent to the relationship manager about the documentation deadline.",
