ou are informed that you may, if helpful, call quick verification utilities to retrieve a concise profile of NovaTech and Orion Global FZE, view a small sample of NovaTech’s most recent transactions, check for summaries of any prior alerts on these parties, and confirm up-to-date screening results.\n\nYou are asked to review this alert and provide a concise risk assessment and recommendation on whether to allow the activity to proceed, place a temporary hold pending further information, or escalate for investigative action, using the case file and any spot checks you choose to run with the available utilities.",
